  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved working conditions in line with labour law and international standards.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO established strategy for improving working conditions in line with Labour Law and international labour standards (ILS) focuses on providing technical advisory services, advice, assistance and support, and capacity building in several technical areas, including labour inspection and occupational safety and health (OSH). The ILO has provided technical support to the Government of Iraq (GoI) and social partners on conducting a comprehensive assessment of the labour inspection system and developing a national OSH profile, which both provided a clear diagnosis of the relevant situation at the national level, including in the Kurdistan region. Based on this, national labour inspection and occupational safety and health policies were also developed in consultation with the social partners. This being the case, the ILO is now planning to provide the necessary support to the GoI and social partners to implement the new policies that have been endorsed by the GoI and social partners.</narrative>
  </description>
